Package: sftpgo
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: systemd
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/drakkan/sftpgo
Description: Full-featured file transfer server (SFTP/WebDAV/FTP) with web UIs
 SFTPGo is a full-featured and highly configurable file transfer server
 supporting SFTP, WebDAV, FTP/S and HTTP/S, with local and cloud storage
 backends. It bundles both the WebAdmin UI (manage users, folders, groups,
 event rules, shares) and the WebClient UI (browser file access, shares,
 two-factor authentication).
 .
 This TOS package runs the upstream static Go binary (SQLite data provider,
 zero runtime dependencies). Web UIs and WebDAV are served behind the TOS
 web server route /sftpgo/ (backend on loopback only); the REST API is
 exposed at /sftpgo/api/v2/. SFTP listens on port 2022. Data is stored in
 /var/lib/sftpgo.
